+    manager) loads with the Referer private:OpenEvent, which stays in the model's arguments. Needed
+    when SfxFrame::Appear() shows the frame before LoadEnv does (filters with a dialog, e.g. CSV). */
+bool lcl_openedFromOutside(const uno::Reference<frame::XFrame>& xFrame)
+{
+    try
